sequenceDiagram
    participant A as 请求 A
    participant B as 请求 B
    participant S as CachedSearchService
    participant C as Cache
    participant E as Search Engine

    A->>S: search(same key)
    S->>C: get(key)
    C-->>S: miss
    S->>S: 创建 InFlight，A 成为 owner
    B->>S: search(same key)
    S->>C: get(key)
    C-->>S: miss
    S->>S: 发现已有 InFlight
    S-->>B: condition_variable 等待
    S->>C: owner 二次检查
    C-->>S: miss
    S->>E: 只执行一次回源计算
    E-->>S: JSON
    S->>C: put(key, JSON)
    S->>S: done=true, notify_all
    S-->>A: JSON
    S-->>B: 复用同一 JSON

